Package: aRtifacts
Title: aRtifacts: Schema-Agnostic Dataset Observability Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zelos", "Zhu", , "zelos.zhu@atorusresearch.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: A lightweight, schema-agnostic S7-based snapshot, diff, and rule
    engine for longitudinal dataset observability. The core engine works with
    any tabular data that has a defined key structure and executes bundled
    topology starter packs (`A0` to `A7`). Domain-specific rule modules are
    intended to live in companion packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://zdz2101.github.io/aRtifacts/,
   https://github.com/zdz2101/aRtifacts
